    { "type": "text", "id": "ov_outcome_wrong_desc", "x": 108, "y": 570, "width": 300, "height": 105,
      "text": "Server applies A's insert first,\ngiving \"ABXYCDE\". B's delete\nstill targets raw position 3 --\nbut that's now 'Y', not 'D'.\n\nResult: \"ABXCDE\" -- the wrong\ncharacter is gone.",
      "originalText": "Server applies A's insert first,\ngiving \"ABXYCDE\". B's delete\nstill targets raw position 3 --\nbut that's now 'Y', not 'D'.\n\nResult: \"ABXCDE\" -- the wrong\ncharacter is gone.",
